{"seq":2,"slug":"core-concepts","title":"Core Concepts","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/core-concepts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"management-by-objectives","title":"目标管理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/core-concepts/management-by-objectives","wordCount":1613,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-knowledge-worker","title":"知识工作者","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/core-concepts/the-knowledge-worker","wordCount":1692,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现德鲁克两个影响深远的核心理念。&quot;目标管理&quot;（MBO）——通过设定明确的目标来引导、协调、激励组织与个人，其精髓在于&quot;自我控制&quot;与&quot;共同目标&quot;，被全球无数组织广泛采用。&quot;知识工作者&quot;——德鲁克早在半个多世纪前便预见了知识工作者的崛起、知识经济的到来，深刻地揭示了现代社会从工业时代向知识时代的根本变迁。本章揭示德鲁克前瞻而深刻的核心理念。</p>\n"}